{
  "_howto": [
    "TWO GRIDS: 'members' renders under the Legion Members section (official-member",
    "riders); 'friends' renders under Friends of the Legion (creators we ride",
    "with but who are NOT in the Legion). Same entry shape in both arrays.",
    "HOW TO ADD A RIDER: replace a placeholder object with:",
    "{\"handle\": \"@name\", \"url\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@name\",",
    "\"avatar\": \"thumbs/so-name.webp\", \"blurb\": \"optional short descriptor\"}.",
    "Optional \"stats\" field: a second info line under the blurb, e.g.",
    "Optional \"handleImg\": an SVG/PNG wordmark rendered in place of the handle text (the handle stays as alt text).",
    "\"stats\": \"1.2K views · 300 likes · 50 followers\" (use the ' · ' separator).",
    "Optional \"creatorKey\": a stats.json creators key (spartanh2/zhwho/freewillridez) - the stats line is then built LIVE from stats.json totals and the static \"stats\" string becomes a fallback.",
    "MEMBERS ONLY: creatorKey/stats belong to 'members' entries - friends are",
    "not tracked, so 'friends' entries never get a creatorKey or stats line.",
    "Put a small square avatar image in the repo at that path (webp preferred, ~160px).",
    "Placeholder slots use avatar shoutout-placeholder.svg and link to the Discord.",
    "Set \"enabled\": false to hide both sections.",
    "Push to main; the site deploys automatically."
  ],
